Subject: server: start Baton's layers and reactors; Baton's own migration manifest (D48)

server.ts provides Baton's services; OrchestrationReactor starts the synopsis, rule and rotation
reactors; the Sqlite layer runs Baton's manifest and the reclaim. Replaced by baton.sqlite in the
v2 port.

